# Licensed typefaces: Amazon Ember / Ember Modern are proprietary and must not
# be committed or redistributed. The source bundle lives at the repo root for
# local use only; assets/fonts/ holds the two web weights the Amazon Music card
# asks for. Because these are ignored, the deployed site falls back to the
# stack in style.css. See assets/fonts/README.md.
Amazon Fonts/
